msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now you’re resorting to “souls” and “next lives”?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’m genuinely "
"impressed. ⟪k:6⟫What lies are you going to cook up next, white-haired knave?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ricorri alle “anime” e alle “prossime vite” adesso?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sono "
"sinceramente impressionato.⟪k:6⟫ Quali altre bugie hai in serbo⟪k:7⟫per me, lurida canaglia dai "
"capelli bianchi?"

